{"4622260":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"放置斩魔录","steam_appid":4622260,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4774060],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/44e3b2866ed96e17c8374065924fdf76.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位角色都不仅拥有独立技能与天赋设计，还具备两套不同的技能流派方向。 <br>你可以根据队伍需求与战斗目标，自由选择输出、辅助、生存、持续作战等不同思路，并通过武学秘籍与心法系统进一步扩展角色能力，让同一名角色在不同构筑下呈现出完全不同的战斗表现。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/ca4b1d0f6889eb38f0e158e75b99fd46.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏包含两套装备体系：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>随机装备<\/strong> <br>主属性固定，附加词条随机生成。玩家可以通过掉落、打造、洗练与搭配，不断追求更适合自己流派的高质量装备。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>独立装备<\/strong> <br>当前版本设计了 200 多件独立装备。它们拥有固定词条与专属特殊效果，能够直接改变构筑方向或强化特定机制，为 BD 组合提供更加明确的思路。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你既可以围绕独立装备构筑核心机制，也可以将其与随机装备混搭，在数值提升与机制联动之间找到更强的组合。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fde0843b4ed66fd4ecb6f9b3b23b2077.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了战斗之外，你还可以发展自己的领地，通过不同建筑推进养成体系：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>修炼室<\/strong>：修炼角色技能与辅修能力<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>炼丹房<\/strong>：炼制境界突破、战斗强化与属性养成所需丹药<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>铁匠铺<\/strong>：打造装备、合成材料、镶嵌宝石、洗练词条<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>珍宝阁<\/strong>：购买珍贵道具与强力装备<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>灵宝坛<\/strong>：供奉具有独特效果的灵宝，强化养成、领地发展与战斗能力<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >领地系统将资源获取、角色成长与装备养成串联起来，让挂机收益与长期经营形成稳定循环。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/6eff72a9488f46466027df2ef827d754.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你所扮演的身份是镇魔司麾下的镇魔使。 <br>随着官职提升，你将获得更高权限、更丰厚的俸禄，并可接取奖励更优厚的差事任务，解锁更多可兑换的强力装备与稀有道具。官职系统既是成长目标的一部分，也会持续为队伍培养提供新的资源来源。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/9398c5ec5bf5d8ef8002b55bc41906a0.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在基础玩法上，你可以通过扫图挂机持续积累资源，逐步强化自己的角色与装备。 <br>与此同时，游戏也提供了大量副本内容，以及副本专属独立装备供玩家挑战获取。副本不仅是重要的成长来源，也是检验阵容搭配、角色养成与构筑强度的关键舞台。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/16251fa3e803b8af0012748a9f67af1a.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了常规挂机与副本玩法外，游戏还提供可使用自养成角色参与的肉鸽模式“试练塔”。 <br>你可以带着自己培养完成的角色与装备进入试练塔，在挑战过程中选择不同造化，并抽取机缘强化队伍。不同机缘之间还会产生共鸣效果，形成更多临场构筑变化。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当前版本中，试练塔包含：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 种造化<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >79 张机缘卡牌<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 种机缘共鸣<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在挂机成长之外，你还可以通过试练塔体验更强调即时选择与组合变化的战斗乐趣。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>当前版本内容<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏当前版本计划提供：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 名可培养角色<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每名角色 2 套技能流派<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打造，强化，洗练，镶嵌，合成，天赋树<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 多件独立装备<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17种不同套装<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50本以上内功心法<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 张地图和2张秘境地图<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每张地图 10 个关卡，每个秘境4个boss<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种副本挑战内容<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完整的领地经营、官职成长、装备养成与试练塔玩法<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>官方交流群<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>放置斩魔录1群 <\/strong>1104775395（已满）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>放置斩魔录2群 <\/strong>964051939<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/44e3b2866ed96e17c8374065924fdf76.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/4f84b983c91bc8329a38e903cce412c9.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位角色都不仅拥有独立技能与天赋设计，还具备两套不同的技能流派方向。 <br>你可以根据队伍需求与战斗目标，自由选择输出、辅助、生存、持续作战等不同思路，并通过武学秘籍与心法系统进一步扩展角色能力，让同一名角色在不同构筑下呈现出完全不同的战斗表现。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/ca4b1d0f6889eb38f0e158e75b99fd46.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/b68fcda5d2ebb2e4a4d8307ecf873376.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏包含两套装备体系：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>随机装备<\/strong> <br>主属性固定，附加词条随机生成。玩家可以通过掉落、打造、洗练与搭配，不断追求更适合自己流派的高质量装备。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>独立装备<\/strong> <br>当前版本设计了 200 多件独立装备。它们拥有固定词条与专属特殊效果，能够直接改变构筑方向或强化特定机制，为 BD 组合提供更加明确的思路。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你既可以围绕独立装备构筑核心机制，也可以将其与随机装备混搭，在数值提升与机制联动之间找到更强的组合。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fde0843b4ed66fd4ecb6f9b3b23b2077.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/716b3d165b9d8ae982d949ce98d97ebd.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了战斗之外，你还可以发展自己的领地，通过不同建筑推进养成体系：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>修炼室<\/strong>：修炼角色技能与辅修能力<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>炼丹房<\/strong>：炼制境界突破、战斗强化与属性养成所需丹药<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>铁匠铺<\/strong>：打造装备、合成材料、镶嵌宝石、洗练词条<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>珍宝阁<\/strong>：购买珍贵道具与强力装备<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>灵宝坛<\/strong>：供奉具有独特效果的灵宝，强化养成、领地发展与战斗能力<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >领地系统将资源获取、角色成长与装备养成串联起来，让挂机收益与长期经营形成稳定循环。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/6eff72a9488f46466027df2ef827d754.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/890a7b1eed52143f77de8902cc5edfbc.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你所扮演的身份是镇魔司麾下的镇魔使。 <br>随着官职提升，你将获得更高权限、更丰厚的俸禄，并可接取奖励更优厚的差事任务，解锁更多可兑换的强力装备与稀有道具。官职系统既是成长目标的一部分，也会持续为队伍培养提供新的资源来源。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/9398c5ec5bf5d8ef8002b55bc41906a0.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/2a025611ec160d2d40362c8eb66eede6.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在基础玩法上，你可以通过扫图挂机持续积累资源，逐步强化自己的角色与装备。 <br>与此同时，游戏也提供了大量副本内容，以及副本专属独立装备供玩家挑战获取。副本不仅是重要的成长来源，也是检验阵容搭配、角色养成与构筑强度的关键舞台。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/16251fa3e803b8af0012748a9f67af1a.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=144 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.poster.avif?t=1791513770\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.webm?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/extras\/fe31e547a57fdae71ffbd44d22f1617d.mp4?t=1791513770\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >除了常规挂机与副本玩法外，游戏还提供可使用自养成角色参与的肉鸽模式“试练塔”。 <br>你可以带着自己培养完成的角色与装备进入试练塔，在挑战过程中选择不同造化，并抽取机缘强化队伍。不同机缘之间还会产生共鸣效果，形成更多临场构筑变化。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当前版本中，试练塔包含：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 种造化<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >79 张机缘卡牌<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 种机缘共鸣<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在挂机成长之外，你还可以通过试练塔体验更强调即时选择与组合变化的战斗乐趣。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>当前版本内容<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏当前版本计划提供：<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 名可培养角色<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每名角色 2 套技能流派<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打造，强化，洗练，镶嵌，合成，天赋树<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 多件独立装备<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17种不同套装<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50本以上内功心法<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 张地图和2张秘境地图<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每张地图 10 个关卡，每个秘境4个boss<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种副本挑战内容<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完整的领地经营、官职成长、装备养成与试练塔玩法<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>官方交流群<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>放置斩魔录1群 <\/strong>1104775395（已满）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>放置斩魔录2群 <\/strong>964051939<\/p>","short_description":"这是一款融合放置挂机、回合制战斗与流派构筑的武侠养成游戏。培养角色、组合技能流派、搭配随机装备与独立装备，在领地经营、副本挑战与试练塔中打造属于你的最强阵容。","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/3a9c6231ee6603521c6440612d81fc2ed48abc11\/header.jpg?t=1791513770","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/2c458297e14f99242bfc0d486c23f0fb9b14ffe0\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791513770","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/2c458297e14f99242bfc0d486c23f0fb9b14ffe0\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791513770","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2100 \/ AMD FX-4300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R7 360<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["三两人工作室"],"publishers":["三两人工作室"],"demos":[{"appid":4774060,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":599,"final":599,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$5.99"},"packages":[1610150],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy 放置斩魔录","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1610150,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"放置斩魔录 - $5.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":599}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/543bc0217e0dd6f2f08b534634b2de4724bc131d\/ss_543bc0217e0dd6f2f08b534634b2de4724bc131d.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/543bc0217e0dd6f2f08b534634b2de4724bc131d\/ss_543bc0217e0dd6f2f08b534634b2de4724bc131d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/d527db1f5792b4460dea88faeb264cd90bab407b\/ss_d527db1f5792b4460dea88faeb264cd90bab407b.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/d527db1f5792b4460dea88faeb264cd90bab407b\/ss_d527db1f5792b4460dea88faeb264cd90bab407b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/421beafb272a04f34f0d5fe79424d7d68eec61f0\/ss_421beafb272a04f34f0d5fe79424d7d68eec61f0.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/421beafb272a04f34f0d5fe79424d7d68eec61f0\/ss_421beafb272a04f34f0d5fe79424d7d68eec61f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/6f52bdc170cca830f5265879a4e0ffc1c6a0a166\/ss_6f52bdc170cca830f5265879a4e0ffc1c6a0a166.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/6f52bdc170cca830f5265879a4e0ffc1c6a0a166\/ss_6f52bdc170cca830f5265879a4e0ffc1c6a0a166.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/e4efd054d0e855e0d08a6bf3f04d009b1a112f1f\/ss_e4efd054d0e855e0d08a6bf3f04d009b1a112f1f.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/e4efd054d0e855e0d08a6bf3f04d009b1a112f1f\/ss_e4efd054d0e855e0d08a6bf3f04d009b1a112f1f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/a48175ea06bbc566c793e895978d10e211c9844c\/ss_a48175ea06bbc566c793e895978d10e211c9844c.600x338.jpg?t=1791513770","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/a48175ea06bbc566c793e895978d10e211c9844c\/ss_a48175ea06bbc566c793e895978d10e211c9844c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791513770"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4622260\/15785a77bec